**/.terraform/
**/terraform.tfstate
**/terraform.tfstate.*
**/.terraform.tfstate.lock.info
**/*.tfplan
**/tfplan
**/crash.log
**/*_override.tf
**/override.tf

# Keep lock files if operators explicitly commit provider pins.
!**/.terraform.lock.hcl

# Only non-secret, reviewed workspace configuration may be committed.
**/environments/*secret*.tfvars
**/environments/*.local.tfvars
**/environments/*.auto.tfvars
